WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Kivmo 1.0 (17): offline focus and break timer

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:10.600
User taps Start focus

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:17.300
User returns to Android home; timer continues in background

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:28.800
User taps Pause in ongoing notification

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:42.700
App shows paused timer; user chooses Stop

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:48.700
User starts the optional break timer

00:00:48.700 --> 00:00:57.900
User ends the break

00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:01.400
Timer is idle; foreground session has ended
